// A harness script (`net::harness::Script`) for the dedicated server: a flat patch on the shipped
// heightmap, centre x=680 z=-520 (MEASURED from `terrain_height.png`: 4 cm relief over the ±10 m
// square both lanes' spawn footprints cover, no map object within 45 m), y = that square's highest
// ground (10.787 m) + 2 m spawn clearance, as `terrain_grid::spawn_pos` places a spawn; identity
// rotation. The lane spawn's default sits at the world origin, a slope the tanks slide apart on;
// lane 1 lands 8 m along +x from lane 0. Fixture data of the shot and pen cam runners
// (`scripts/shot/`, `scripts/perf/run-pencam-cost.sh`), not of any tank.
(
    spawn_pose: (pos: (680.0, 12.79, -520.0), rot: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)),
)
